# Copy to `.env` (gitignored) and customize.

# uv PyTorch wheel backend autodetect (per python-ml-uv brainstorm B3=A).
# Auto-detects MPS (macOS) / CUDA (Linux+GPU) / CPU at install time.
# Override with a specific backend if needed: cpu | cu130 | cu128 | mps | rocm
# See: https://docs.astral.sh/uv/guides/integration/pytorch/
UV_TORCH_BACKEND=auto

# Cloud vision judge for HELD-OUT GROUND TRUTH ONLY (ADR-060).
# Needed exclusively by `scripts/judge_heldout_gt.py`, which authors the answer key for
# the private Belege set by reading the page rasters. NOT used anywhere on the inference
# path — the delivered HORUS pipeline is fully local and makes no cloud calls, which is
# the project's central privacy claim. Leave unset and the judge refuses to run
# (exit code 2) rather than silently degrading.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Azure AI Document Intelligence — SECOND held-out GT channel, Tier B only.
# 13 of the 39 held-out documents have no usable text layer, so no deterministic source
# can settle their values; they need two independent readings plus author sign-off.
# `prebuilt-invoice` is a specialist (dedicated OCR + invoice field model), so its errors
# are uncorrelated with the generalist VLM's — which is the entire point of a second
# channel. Setup runbook: `scripts/azure/README.md`. Also GT-authoring only, never on the
# inference path.
AZURE_DOCUMENT_INTELLIGENCE_ENDPOINT=
AZURE_DOCUMENT_INTELLIGENCE_KEY=
